Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,花梨…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,淅瀝嘩啦 下雨啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸 撐著傘來接我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好開心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跳啊跳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 你喔\N- 啪沙啪沙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐很喜歡這把傘的說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 真拿你沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再買一把給你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.78,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,回家囉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜歡這個季節
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:23.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ愛したいこれは真実？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:27.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ愛されたいのは不誠実？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:29.58,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,もうどうすればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:32.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,どうすればいいのか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,街はいつも通り今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:42.03,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,惚れた腫れたで色めきたつ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:45.53,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,エキストラは家に帰るだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.53,0:01:49.03,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,不貞腐れてやしないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:52.78,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そんな日々を切り裂くように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:56.28,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,突然現れた君は
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:59.78,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,痺れるような笑顔で僕の
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:04.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,心を砕いて見せた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:08.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ愛したいこれは真実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:12.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ愛されたいのは不誠実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.45,0:02:14.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,もうどうすればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:17.50,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,どうすればいいのか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,って分からないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:23.32,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,その頭の中が分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:26.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,でも愛想は良いとかずるいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:32.00,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,こうやってまた君のペースに飲まれてく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:39.20,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そうやってまたほら振り回されてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:49.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そうやってまたほら振り回されてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:23.87,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,吶 我想愛你 這是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:27.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,只想被愛就不算誠實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:29.58,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:32.25,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,今天的城市依舊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:42.03,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,令人神魂顛倒 興奮不已
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:45.53,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,臨時演員只是回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.53,0:01:49.03,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,絕對不是在彆扭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:52.78,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,彷彿劃破這樣的日子一般
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:56.28,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,突然出現的你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:59.78,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,帶著令人陶醉的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:04.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,讓我明白了心碎的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:08.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,吶 我想愛你 這是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:12.45,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,只想被愛就不算誠實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.45,0:02:14.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:17.50,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,不知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:23.32,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在想什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:26.87,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,你卻如此惹人憐愛 真不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:32.00,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,就這樣 我又被你拉走節奏了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:39.20,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,於是你看 我又被任意擺布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:49.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,於是你看 我又被任意擺布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸 我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐 你的雨衣…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,零 拿毛巾過來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,毛巾啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐也要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 先去洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這樣吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,#07 雨過天晴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再來玩魔利歐賽車
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你輸了就會生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會生氣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 大毛巾呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?大毛巾?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,老師說要帶去托兒所
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,零 毛巾繡好姓名了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我有拜託你吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,零 喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這樣吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看…針線盒在哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我洗好澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好喔 頭髮有擦乾嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸 美俐也要玩魔利歐賽車
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我說啊 零
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你也照顧一下美俐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?我有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?你做了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,陪她玩遊戲 之類的?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,都整天只關在家裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:04:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可以多幫忙照顧一下美俐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我有在努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我看沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼那傢伙會在這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你在這種地方做什麼呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,噓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭啦 人家好寂寞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,來陪我玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我今天有事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近都沒找我們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你該不會有了重要的人吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,果然被說中了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我今天真的有事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,幸福…是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,洗衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,洗碗 做飯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,幫她洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,洗衣服 洗碗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所謂的幸福…真的是這樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 人家要抱抱啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,很危險 不要黏著我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抱抱…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不陪人家玩嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,零
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你去開門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 抱抱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 給人家抱抱啦\N- 好啦…我馬上來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我討厭吃這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸 給你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜歡吃番茄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐也不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,幸福…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:07:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?怎麼變多了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕吃香菇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭啦 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 吃下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,番茄也給你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 髒兮兮的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼不想吃的話 就不要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是甜食 美俐就吃得下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 那我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃法式吐司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就這個吧 反正很好做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好做…?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸 我要吃法式吐司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你們的男傭啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,男傭是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,幫忙做家事的人…吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,到處都找不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,（我暫時不回來了 一騎）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸 我要吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要吃飯…\N- 哪個才是飯?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 好久沒吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因為一騎爸爸不准我們吃嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,明明這麼好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 今天的托兒所呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,該帶什麼才好?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.75,UP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1410,140)}聯絡簿\N更換的衣服\N髒衣物袋\N浴巾\N擦手巾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,唉 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,雨傘呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,壞掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好快喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好冰喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才一早就離家出走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,零就不會去照顧美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我有多重要 這下美俐她…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,總該知道了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,每次人家在打掃 洗衣服的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他們兩個卻只會玩遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,吃飯時也在那邊挑食
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,覺得你好像樂在其中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?哪有?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你變了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,幹嘛突然這麼說?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的小姨子又把錢退回了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看來她還是不願收下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好跟她談談吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,柚子的親人只剩下花梨了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都五年了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,忌日不是快到了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你也該差不多…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 我就盡情放鬆一下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝招待
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒變 什麼都沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 要找什麼樂子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪 都沒有人在耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,杏奈呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 手氣正旺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 今天的阿一有夠猛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,超帥的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,讚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的 上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,沒中 等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,慶祝阿一連戰連勝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,想點什麼就點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,儘管端上桌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃披薩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,別吃那種寒酸的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,點壽司吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哈啾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要叫披薩嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,披薩!我要吃!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,綜合披薩一張 中的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去掉番茄和青椒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也要記得吃蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸有說過喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,加點一份炸薯條
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好久沒有喝過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,才這麼早啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不快點回家的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,會被媽媽罵喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哼 什麼家人嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,痛 哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛耶 小心點好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?你想怎樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,洗好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸沒有回來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我們兩個啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,被拋棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,少神氣了 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,誰知道你有同伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,世人心中的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,下場就是要這麼慘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴上冠冕堂皇的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,會讓家人陷入更大的不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真是活該呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,柚…子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你還好嗎 一騎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,花梨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.91,0:13:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,終於找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你過得好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你在這種地方搞什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,被打得鼻青臉腫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,全身沾滿垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真像個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不關你的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你聽槲寄生的老闆說了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我們好好談…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,別逃避啊 一騎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真的夠了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不肯好好談
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只會單方面送錢來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不知道你做什麼工作啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不會接受
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也不需要你給的鉅款
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 那我不會再寄錢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊會死並不是一騎的錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 你卻始終…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是我害死她的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,柚…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好熱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,身體不舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,38點5度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼不接?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好熱…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你等等喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.37,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,藥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,（綜合感冒藥）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.98,UP,,0,0,0,,（未滿12歲請勿服用）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我什麼事都做不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,醫院…在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,（柚子）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有忘了你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,久太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,請幫幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊生前很喜歡這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得這是一騎和姊姊\N初次見面的地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜歡姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,當她說要跟你結婚時
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常高興
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她很溫柔又漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,總是笑容滿面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎心中的姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果一直是愁眉苦臉的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我討厭這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,已經五年了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,夠了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,其實 我很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:18:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕改變
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,逐漸忘了害死她的罪惡感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,滿足於其他事物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,會不會一改變 就再也想不起她?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我好怕這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不想改變
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,回憶可不是牢籠喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊 要去留學了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,要去法國學習服飾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都很想去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易考上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,以前姊姊都很為我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,終於去報告喜訊了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎也向前邁進吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣一來 姊姊一定會比較幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她也會幸福嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 身為妹妹的我向你保證
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這個說法很詐耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,雨終於停了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說你最近在照顧親戚的孩子?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是阿久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 那個多嘴的眼鏡男
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,其實也沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只是剛好變成托我照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很好啊 開心嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,才怪 忙得要死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她都不聽話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎一定也能讓那孩子幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,陽光也露臉了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就再努力看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我到家囉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 跟我料想的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,（內服藥 海坂美俐）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…法式吐司?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吃看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:21:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我下次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,會嚴格地教你們什麼叫法式吐司
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 美俐?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是零爸爸說交給他就好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是雨傘
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,淅瀝嘩啦 下雨啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,兩個爸爸 在家相親相愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好開心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跳啊跳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啪沙啪沙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:37.29,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,変わらない光景予想外の 毎日だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それがいいって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:44.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,振り回されたり空回って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:49.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,目まぐるしく愛おしい日を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:51.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,眠れない夜にそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,口ずさむ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:58.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,子守唄や呼吸に合わせた手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:01.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただただ一日でも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:03.16,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,この日々が
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:08.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,長く長く長く長く続くように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:13.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,裸足で駆ける君を追った
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:17.95,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつか僕を超えて Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.95,0:23:22.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,明日はどんな一日だろうな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:27.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,僕ら一緒に歩いてこうか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.37,0:23:32.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつもここに帰る場所があって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:36.95,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,悲しみも照らすように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:39.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それでもいいか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:41.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それもありかな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:46.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らの愛を分かち合おうか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:52.00,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,予想出来ない未来には希望を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:56.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつまでも照らして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:37.29,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,不變的風景 每天都出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.41,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,但這樣也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:44.45,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,被折騰一番 白忙一場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:49.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,過著眼花撩亂 令人疼惜的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:51.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,在睡不著的夜裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:58.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,手配合著搖籃曲和呼吸拍著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:01.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,就算只有一天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:03.16,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,希望這樣的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:08.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,能夠持續長長久久
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:13.54,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,追逐著赤腳奔跑的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:17.95,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,總有一天會超越我 Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.95,0:23:22.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,明天會是怎樣的一天呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:27.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,我們會一起走下去嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.37,0:23:32.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,在這裡永遠有我的歸處
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:36.95,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,希望連同悲傷都照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:39.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,即便如此也可以嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:41.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,這樣可能嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:46.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,應該分享我們的愛嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:52.00,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,願在不可預知的未來裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:56.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,永遠閃耀著希望
